              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomnyaka wokuqala wokubusa kukaKurosi inkosi yasePerisiya, ukuba kugcwaliseke ilizwi leNkosi eyalikhuluma ngoJeremiya, iNkosi yavusa inhliziyo kaKurosi inkosi yasePeresiya ukuba amemezele embusweni wakhe wonke, alobe futhi athi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
